{"3844360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chocolate Parade", "steam_appid": 3844360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A heavy-weapon battle between the mightiest sweets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chocolate Parade&quot; is a crazy roguelike action game where you roll sweets and unleash heavy weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players (solo or co-op) can create their own parade and compete for coins on a boss-rush battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Unique sweets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge battle unfolds between unique sweets, including a waffle that shoots a machine gun and a Baumkuchen that shoots laser beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844360/extras/8fdaa6bef117dd0bb4c3f8d34c06c780.avif?t=1787146972\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Roll and collect sweets to expand your parade! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing with a gamepad. The casual controls allow anyone to play intuitively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844360/extras/f8ebe62ad5744450acc54d44a93f6031.avif?t=1787146972\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> Exhilarating high-speed boss rush battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844360/extras/d1bf3b34b394dfad1885de8d1797ef3a.avif?t=1787146972\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■<strong> Win the coin battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http